[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8821.59, "timestamp": "02:27:01", "text": "是的，他就在你身后。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8824.63, "timestamp": "02:27:04", "text": "去丛林里做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8829.99, "timestamp": "02:27:09", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8831.91, "timestamp": "02:27:11", "text": "我的天啊。那都是我的错。那是我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8833.14, "timestamp": "02:27:13", "text": "坏的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8838.71, "timestamp": "02:27:18", "text": "哦不，那是我的错。我走进"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8840.469, "timestamp": "02:27:20", "text": "你的火焰。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8842.55, "timestamp": "02:27:22", "text": "我当时想：“等等，那东西又启动了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8846.07, "timestamp": "02:27:26", "text": "我们必须把它打开。”然后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8848.15, "timestamp": "02:27:28", "text": "我们当时就想：“等等，你们在开枪。”哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8851.19, "timestamp": "02:27:31", "text": "不。然后我看到了闪光。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8853.91, "timestamp": "02:27:33", "text": "而这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8856.79, "timestamp": "02:27:36", "text": "我的天啊。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8859.51, "timestamp": "02:27:39", "text": "我认为我们不应该做健康设计。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8863.19, "timestamp": "02:27:43", "text": "哦，不。我们能做到，但我们当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8866.63, "timestamp": "02:27:46", "text": "有点太爱胡闹了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8873.11, "timestamp": "02:27:53", "text": "总之，我想我还是就此打住吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8878.63, "timestamp": "02:27:58", "text": "今天因为，嗯，我已经吃饱了。"}]